                                "sense_id": "3aa9688f-6b32-3af8-8b4b-6e8ae63c0f4c",
                                "text": "Whether this Zuluizing of Mashiloane by Strijdom and Zuluizing of Mtolo by Baba Mandela were coincidences^([sic]), they unfortunately foreshadow the anti-Zulu sentiments […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "2ca4be2c-30a1-4068-b446-42b2c88c5311",
                                "sense_id": "3aa9688f-6b32-3af8-8b4b-6e8ae63c0f4c",
                                "text": "In contrast, guides at the highly capitalized Zulu cultural villages try to teach guests basic Zulu nouns and greetings in an hour or two. Theirs seems to be a mission to \"Zuluize\" tourists […]"
